6:{character:Wanjirou}She was so angry when she left. Hope she didn't do anything stupid...
7:Wanjirou
8:Midari Ikishima
9:Miki Nikaidou
10:Yumeko Jabami
11:{character:Mary Saotome}D-D-D-DOOOOOOOG MONSTER!
14:Mary Saotome
15:{character:Mary Saotome}How can you be so calm? You are the one who's being weird!
16:{character:Miki Nikaidou}Oh, what's the matter, Wanjirou? Did you offend our guests?
17:{character:Wanjirou}I'm the one being offended, woof!
18:{character:Mary Saotome}A human? Are you an exorcist? Please! Dispel this monster!
19:{character:Mary Saotome}Ah, wait a second. If you've appeared in a place like this, who knows what you are? What monster are you? A beautiful lady in a kimono... I get it! You're the Snow Woman!
20:{character:Miki Nikaidou}The Snow Woman doesn't appear at this time of year. Don't worry, I'm a human and a guest here, just like you.
21:{character:Wanjirou}You come here too often to be a guest, don't you think, woof?
23:{character:Wanjirou}I'm not good at this... It's my fault. I'm counting on you, Nikaidou.
24:{character:Mary Saotome}What are you two whispering about? Where on earth is this place? Who are you guys? Explain! Immediately! Now!
25:{character:Miki Nikaidou}Such an impatient guest. Before we explain, let's go through the routine first.
27:{character:Yumeko Jabami}The Mahjong Soul...
28:{character:Mary Saotome}Shrine?
29:{character:Mary Saotome}Hmm... So, this is a shrine where any wish can be granted. And we're here because we have some wishes, right?
30:{character:Yumeko Jabami}Any wish can be granted? Sounds awesome.
31:{character:Mary Saotome}Not awesome at all! Doesn't it sound like a religious scam?
34:{character:Mary Saotome}I can't think of any off the top of my head. We're perfectly happy and healthy, so we're good.
35:{character:Mary Saotome}Let's quit wasting our time here. Let's go, Yumeko.
36:{character:Yumeko Jabami}Eh? But they can grant our wishes here. Wouldn't it be a big waste to leave?
37:{character:Mary Saotome}You actually believe in this... Stay, then. I'll go without you. Uh, how do I get out of here?
38:{character:Wanjirou}I'm not quite sure about how to answer your question, woof. This shrine is not a place that you can just come and go as you wish.
39:{character:Mary Saotome}Huh?!
41:{character:Mary Saotome}Are you... kidding me?
46:Miki&Yumeko
47:{character:Miki Nikaidou}It's windy tonight. I'm sure the wind has calmed her down by now.
50:{character:Yumeko Jabami}…
51:{character:Midari Ikishima}Still ignoring me. Never mind, as long as we continue the game... You'll look at me eventually. Look at me! Yumeko!
52:{character:Miki Nikaidou}Wow, so energetic.
53:{character:Miki Nikaidou}(Her own plans, hmm... But that look wasn't really reassuring.)
54:{character:Miki Nikaidou}(After all, this shrine is bigger than you'd think… She's probably lost her way by now, hehe.)
55:{character:Yumeko Jabami}I'm familiar with the rules now. Let's start the next game. Yet... I can't help but feel something is missing.
56:{character:Miki Nikaidou}You've got a point. The night is long. Mahjong alone won't be enough to pass the time.
58:{character:Yumeko Jabami}Wow, Miss Nikaidou and I are on the same wavelength. What kind of penalty, then?
59:{character:Miki Nikaidou}So impatient... Wanjirou, we haven't finished the takeout Ichihime ordered today, right?
61:{character:Miki Nikaidou}That's right, hehe. The one who finishes in the last place will eat a whole plate of spicy food as a penalty.
62:{character:Yumeko Jabami}Oh?! Does it taste legit?
64:{character:Midari Ikishima}So it's deadly spicy, right? Hehe, it's so spicy it'll burn your nerves off, right…? Alright! Deal!
65:{character:Wanjirou}Wait, woof! Doesn't my opinion matter, woof?!
66:Meanwhile...
67:{character:Mary Saotome}... I'm completely lost.
69:{character:Mary Saotome}*Sigh*... What time is it?
70:{character:Mary Saotome}(I should be able to see more clearly during the day. Generally speaking, I'd better find somewhere to stay overnight, but how am I gonna fall asleep somewhere this sketchy?)
71:{character:Mary Saotome}How long am I gonna stay here…? I have things to do tomorrow. And... Tomorrow is the last day of the field trip.
72:{character:Mary Saotome}The research topic... I haven't even started on it yet.
73:This field trip isn't just about relaxing.
76:{character:Mary Saotome}That Student Council President chose this specific topic just for fun. I'm sure of it.
77:{character:Mary Saotome}Like what is the meaning of this? Is she looking down upon the meaning of education?!
78:{character:???}Just for fun, yes. But I did consider carefully before choosing the topic.
79:{character:Mary Saotome}Eh? Did somebody just say something?!
81:{character:Mary Saotome}President... Kirari Momobami.
82:???
83:Kirari Momobami
