335:{character:Miki Nikaidou}Three consecutive Mangan. You are on a roll, Wanjirou.
336:{character:Yumeko Jabami}Here! 8,000 points. These rules are so exciting, just like I thought they'd be.
337:{character:Wanjirou}You've dealt in 2 Mangan in a row, and you're still so chill, woof? By the way, is your friend really okay on her own?
